{"type":"message","id":"abdbf7ab","parentId":"b221c6a1","timestamp":"2026-03-21T01:54:43.351Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\nUser wants me to do this correctly. I need to:\n1. Spawn coder agent to create the project skeleton\n2. Then spawn reviewer agent to audit it\n3. If reviewer rejects, send feedback to coder\n4. If reviewer approves, commit and push to feature branch\n\nLet me start by spawning the coder agent with the proper task.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b998e2cc","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"agentId":"coder","label":"Create Project Skeleton","runtime":"acp","task":"Create a project skeleton for live football dashboard:\n\n1. Create directory structure:\n   - backend/app/scraper\n   - backend/app/cache\n   - backend/app/api\n   - frontend/src/components\n   - frontend/src/pages\n   - frontend/src/hooks\n\n2. Create files:\n   - backend/requirements.txt with FastAPI, aiohttp, redis, pydantic\n   - backend/.env.example\n   - backend/app/main.py - FastAPI app with mock data and endpoints\n   - backend/app/scraper/livesport_scraper.py - Scraper class template\n   - backend/app/cache/cache_manager.py - In-memory cache with TTL\n   - backend/app/api/routes.py - API route handlers\n   - backend/app/api/schemas.py - Pydantic models\n   - frontend/package.json\n   - frontend/index.html - Simple dashboard UI\n   - frontend/README.md\n   - backend/README.md\n   - README.md - Project overview\n   - .gitignore\n\n3. Initialize git repository\n4. Create feature branch: feature/skeleton\n5. Commit all changes\n6. Report back with branch name and what's ready to test"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"1e20fd8d42056f870933bf98ca6211024744f7ec","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":177