{"type":"message","id":"231c7288","parentId":"0dfcca15","timestamp":"2026-03-21T02:03:24.353Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\nOK, teď zkusím spawnovat agenta `coder` s `runtime: \"acp\"` a `agentId: \"coder\"`. Pojďme na to:\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fb03e09d","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"agentId":"coder","label":"Implement Scraper for livesport.cz","runtime":"acp","task":"Implement actual scraper for livesport.cz:\n\n1. Update `backend/app/scraper/livesport_scraper.py`:\n   - Use aiohttp with proper headers (User-Agent, Accept-Language)\n   - Implement HTML parsing with BeautifulSoup4\n   - Parse live matches from https://www.livesport.cz/football\n   - Extract: home team, away team, scores, minute, league\n   - Handle multiple leagues (Czech Liga, Premier League, etc.)\n\n2. Update `backend/app/main.py`:\n   - Integrate scraper with FastAPI\n   - Use CacheManager to store match data\n   - Add periodic update mechanism (every 30 seconds)\n   - Add WebSocket support for real-time updates\n\n3. Update `requirements.txt`:\n   - Add beautifulsoup4, websocket-server, pydantic-settings\n\n4. Create `backend/app/scheduler.py`:\n   - Background task to refresh match data\n   - Auto-update cache and invalidate old data\n\n5. Test locally - verify you can fetch real live matches\n\nReport back with: working scraper, branch name, what's tested."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"1e20fd8d42056f870933bf98ca6211024744f7ec","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774058594566}}
